1
00:01:41,945 --> 00:01:43,225
Dad!

2
00:01:43,305 --> 00:01:44,745
Dad!

3
00:01:44,825 --> 00:01:46,625
Dad!

4
00:02:06,145 --> 00:02:07,745
Give my daughter back.

5
00:02:09,265 --> 00:02:10,304
Or…

6
00:02:10,825 --> 00:02:12,465
I won't leave,

7
00:02:12,985 --> 00:02:14,585
even if you run me over a thousand times.

8
00:02:15,465 --> 00:02:17,185
Don't chicken out.

9
00:02:17,265 --> 00:02:18,665
Floor it!

10
00:02:18,745 --> 00:02:20,305
Run him over!

11
00:02:20,385 --> 00:02:21,385
Dad!

12
00:02:21,465 --> 00:02:23,185
Don't hit my dad!

13
00:02:26,065 --> 00:02:27,185
Dad!

14
00:02:32,065 --> 00:02:33,385
Dad!

15
00:02:35,225 --> 00:02:37,065
Give my daughter…

16
00:02:37,145 --> 00:02:38,385
back.

17
00:02:42,065 --> 00:02:43,425
Turn around. Run.

18
00:02:52,345 --> 00:02:54,465
That's what you get
for running over my dad!

19
00:02:54,545 --> 00:02:55,385
How can you run over my dad!

20
00:02:55,465 --> 00:02:56,785
Sir!

21
00:02:56,865 --> 00:02:59,585
That's what you get
for running over my dad!

22
00:02:59,665 --> 00:03:01,385
That's what you get
for running over my dad!

23
00:03:01,465 --> 00:03:03,105
-Xiaohe.
-How dare you!

24
00:03:03,185 --> 00:03:05,065
-Xiaohe.
-How dare you!

25
00:03:05,945 --> 00:03:07,385
-Quick.
-Dad!

26
00:03:07,465 --> 00:03:08,385
Dad!

27
00:03:09,145 --> 00:03:11,345
Dad! Wake up!

28
00:03:11,425 --> 00:03:13,425
Don't sleep. Dad!

29
00:03:13,505 --> 00:03:15,025
Wake up.

30
00:03:15,785 --> 00:03:18,625
Wake up, Dad! Dad!

31
00:03:23,425 --> 00:03:24,465
Xiaohe.

32
00:03:25,425 --> 00:03:26,705
I'm fine.

33
00:03:28,225 --> 00:03:30,665
Am I rocking it

34
00:03:31,185 --> 00:03:33,025
today?

35
00:03:40,505 --> 00:03:41,705
-Wake up, Dad!
-Sir!

36
00:03:41,785 --> 00:03:43,945
Don't sleep!

37
00:03:44,025 --> 00:03:45,065
Sir.

38
00:03:45,825 --> 00:03:47,745
-Quick. Call an ambulance.
-Okay.

39
00:03:48,465 --> 00:03:49,305
Sir!

40
00:03:50,145 --> 00:03:51,225
Hurry. Drag him out. Quick.

41
00:03:52,585 --> 00:03:53,745
Sir!

42
00:03:53,825 --> 00:03:56,065
-Wake up! Don't sleep, sir!
-How is he?

43
00:03:57,065 --> 00:03:58,025
His bones are fine.

44
00:03:58,105 --> 00:04:00,425
Sir. Sir. Don't sleep.

45
00:04:00,505 --> 00:04:02,345
Mei said there was a roadblock
on the highway.

46
00:04:02,425 --> 00:04:04,465
Turn left at the next intersection.
There's a workshop.

47
00:04:04,545 --> 00:04:05,505
<i>He'll be waiting for us there.</i>

48
00:04:05,585 --> 00:04:06,545
Uncle Ran.

49
00:04:07,145 --> 00:04:08,545
The human traffickers are there.

50
00:04:10,905 --> 00:04:11,825
HOMELY WORKSHOP

51
00:04:26,265 --> 00:04:28,425
AHAO AUTO MAINTENANCE

52
00:04:28,505 --> 00:04:29,585
POLICE

53
00:04:49,305 --> 00:04:50,425
Qu.

54
00:05:38,385 --> 00:05:40,145
This is the only construction area

55
00:05:40,225 --> 00:05:41,385
within all three schools.

56
00:05:42,345 --> 00:05:44,545
Only this spot
doesn't have security cameras.

57
00:05:51,625 --> 00:05:52,865
Let's get to work.

58
00:06:00,985 --> 00:06:02,625
Mister, I need your help.

59
00:06:02,705 --> 00:06:04,185
Have you seen these kids?

60
00:06:04,265 --> 00:06:06,785
Do you know anyone here who gives rides?

61
00:06:06,865 --> 00:06:07,745
No.

62
00:06:08,345 --> 00:06:09,385
Have you seen these kids?

63
00:06:09,465 --> 00:06:10,585
Have you seen these kids?

64
00:06:10,665 --> 00:06:12,945
-Have you seen these five kids?
-No.

65
00:06:19,505 --> 00:06:20,545
I don't know them.

66
00:06:21,345 --> 00:06:22,905
I don't have a car.

67
00:06:22,985 --> 00:06:25,585
I always use a trolley to restock.

68
00:06:26,825 --> 00:06:27,985
All right then.

69
00:06:30,065 --> 00:06:31,385
Wait.

70
00:06:31,465 --> 00:06:34,465
Someone who gives rides?
You can ask that shop.

71
00:06:34,545 --> 00:06:36,665
The owner loves to give people rides

72
00:06:36,745 --> 00:06:39,105
when he restocks.

73
00:06:39,185 --> 00:06:40,505
He is quite scary-looking.

74
00:06:40,585 --> 00:06:44,225
I heard that he was imprisoned once
for kidnapping.

75
00:06:45,185 --> 00:06:46,385
Gaoyishou?

76
00:06:53,065 --> 00:06:54,825
The chef is on a break.

77
00:06:54,905 --> 00:06:56,385
We open at five.

78
00:06:56,465 --> 00:06:57,705
Where is your boss?

79
00:06:59,705 --> 00:07:01,825
We're from the Nanshan Branch.
We're asking about people giving rides.

80
00:07:07,305 --> 00:07:09,945
He went home to sleep.
Please return at 4:30 p.m.

81
00:07:22,985 --> 00:07:24,105
Stand right there!

82
00:07:26,945 --> 00:07:28,865
It hurts! Madam. Not so rough.

83
00:07:28,945 --> 00:07:30,465
It hurts!

84
00:07:30,545 --> 00:07:31,665
Not so rough.

85
00:07:31,745 --> 00:07:33,505
Not so rough. It hurts.

86
00:07:33,585 --> 00:07:35,025
PROSPEROUS BUSINESS

87
00:07:36,345 --> 00:07:38,425
I've never given kids a ride.

88
00:07:38,945 --> 00:07:41,505
You can check the dashcam in my car.

89
00:07:42,105 --> 00:07:44,305
What's with your criminal record
of kidnapping?

90
00:07:44,945 --> 00:07:46,065
Who told you that?

91
00:07:47,465 --> 00:07:48,625
Was it the woman from--

92
00:07:48,705 --> 00:07:50,745
Just answer my question.

93
00:07:52,225 --> 00:07:53,665
I already served my sentence.

94
00:07:53,745 --> 00:07:55,225
What more do you want?

95
00:07:56,945 --> 00:07:57,945
Fine.

96
00:07:59,345 --> 00:08:00,465
It was an argument with my wife.

97
00:08:01,305 --> 00:08:02,145
My wife…

98
00:08:02,985 --> 00:08:04,825
Well, my ex-wife

99
00:08:04,905 --> 00:08:06,385
returned to her parents' place
to hide from me.

100
00:08:06,465 --> 00:08:07,905
I was mad,

101
00:08:07,985 --> 00:08:09,985
so I kidnapped her and starved her.

102
00:08:10,505 --> 00:08:11,825
I was jailed for three years.

103
00:08:12,865 --> 00:08:13,905
Mr. Officer.

104
00:08:14,825 --> 00:08:16,825
I give people rides
when I'm out restocking.

105
00:08:16,905 --> 00:08:18,425
Is that a crime?

106
00:08:18,505 --> 00:08:20,785
Do you have to pin me down and arrest me?

107
00:08:20,865 --> 00:08:22,545
Why did you run just now?

108
00:08:24,625 --> 00:08:25,905
I was arrested once.

109
00:08:26,425 --> 00:08:27,585
Whenever I see police officers,

110
00:08:27,665 --> 00:08:31,145
my legs begin moving before I know it.

111
00:08:31,665 --> 00:08:32,705
Dad.

112
00:08:35,945 --> 00:08:37,105
What?

113
00:08:39,745 --> 00:08:41,945
Isn't she the host on the TV channel?

114
00:08:43,425 --> 00:08:44,785
That's him.

115
00:08:46,465 --> 00:08:48,625
I can recognize him,
even if he has turned into ashes.

116
00:08:56,225 --> 00:08:57,065
Mei.

117
00:08:58,425 --> 00:08:59,465
He's still in Weiyang.

118
00:09:12,265 --> 00:09:13,705
Why aren't they picking up?

119
00:09:21,025 --> 00:09:21,905
<i>Hello, Officer He?</i>

120
00:09:21,985 --> 00:09:22,985
Hey, Ms. Wang.

121
00:09:23,065 --> 00:09:24,745
Can you check if there are
needlestick injuries on Han Zi'ang?

122
00:09:39,665 --> 00:09:41,505
<i>Officer He. I found some.</i>

123
00:09:41,585 --> 00:09:44,905
<i>I found two on his right arm.</i>

124
00:09:50,185 --> 00:09:53,065
Mei is a regular
among the wanted criminals.

125
00:09:53,665 --> 00:09:55,305
He is involved
in many child trafficking cases.

126
00:09:55,385 --> 00:09:57,865
He is cunning and good
at disguising himself.

127
00:09:57,945 --> 00:10:00,545
He has not been arrested
for more than a decade.

128
00:10:00,625 --> 00:10:02,425
Based on the information given
by Officer He Xiaohe,

129
00:10:02,505 --> 00:10:03,585
we can deduce

130
00:10:03,665 --> 00:10:05,585
that Mei lurks around

131
00:10:05,665 --> 00:10:07,745
the construction area near Fuxing Street.

132
00:10:07,825 --> 00:10:11,225
<i>He stalks students who skip classes</i>
<i>to hang out at the illegal internet cafe.</i>

133
00:10:12,345 --> 00:10:14,905
<i>Then, he injects them with anesthetics</i>
<i>before kidnapping them.</i>

134
00:10:25,025 --> 00:10:26,985
The last victim, Han Zi'ang,

135
00:10:27,065 --> 00:10:29,145
is quite different
from the four previous victims.

136
00:10:29,225 --> 00:10:32,545
<i>We believe that after Han Zi'ang</i>
<i>left the internet cafe,</i>

137
00:10:32,625 --> 00:10:34,145
<i>he didn't go home.</i>

138
00:10:34,225 --> 00:10:36,545
<i>Instead, he went to the 18th floor</i>

139
00:10:36,625 --> 00:10:39,225
<i>of New York Block</i>
<i>to explore out of curiosity.</i>

140
00:11:02,505 --> 00:11:05,345
Help! Help! Help!

141
00:11:06,625 --> 00:11:08,705
Help! Help!

142
00:11:11,625 --> 00:11:12,705
After Han Zi'ang,

143
00:11:12,785 --> 00:11:14,065
there has been no new victim.

144
00:11:14,145 --> 00:11:15,105
PERSON OF INTEREST: MEI

145
00:11:15,185 --> 00:11:18,305
That means Han Zi'ang's escape
disrupted Mei's plan.

146
00:11:18,385 --> 00:11:20,785
He had no choice but to stop.
His priority now

147
00:11:20,865 --> 00:11:23,385
is to bring those four victims
out of Weiyang.

148
00:11:23,465 --> 00:11:25,745
Bai, Hui. Print out the wanted posters.

149
00:11:25,825 --> 00:11:27,705
Make sure the photo is huge.

150
00:11:27,785 --> 00:11:29,585
Then, let others post them everywhere.

151
00:11:29,665 --> 00:11:31,945
Xing. Investigate
all egresses of the city.

152
00:11:32,025 --> 00:11:33,145
Check the cameras of bus stations
and train stations

153
00:11:33,225 --> 00:11:34,105
to see if the culprit

154
00:11:34,185 --> 00:11:35,785
-has left Weiyang with the victims.
-Got it.

155
00:11:35,865 --> 00:11:38,665
Mangkun. Bring some men with you
and investigate the motels, hostels,

156
00:11:38,745 --> 00:11:40,505
or warehouses of the district.

157
00:11:40,585 --> 00:11:42,705
The culprit might be hiding
the victims there

158
00:11:42,785 --> 00:11:43,745
before buyers appear.

159
00:11:43,825 --> 00:11:45,145
Guys. Split up.

160
00:11:52,865 --> 00:11:53,705
Xiaohe,

161
00:11:53,785 --> 00:11:55,425
you provided a useful lead.

162
00:11:55,505 --> 00:11:58,025
I allow you to work
with the Special Task Force.

163
00:11:58,105 --> 00:11:59,385
Thank you, sir.

164
00:11:59,465 --> 00:12:01,625
But given the urgency,
is casting your net wide

165
00:12:01,705 --> 00:12:03,065
the best way to do it?

166
00:12:03,705 --> 00:12:05,905
If not, we wait for Mei
to turn himself in?

167
00:12:05,985 --> 00:12:07,105
-But… But we are running out--
-Sorry. Captain Qu.

168
00:12:07,185 --> 00:12:09,505
Xiaohe. Let's go.

169
00:12:09,585 --> 00:12:10,745
Why?

170
00:12:21,185 --> 00:12:23,065
Your deposition was excellent.

171
00:12:23,145 --> 00:12:25,425
And your dad is almost recovered.

172
00:12:36,065 --> 00:12:37,465
Xiaohe,

173
00:12:38,865 --> 00:12:40,185
I owe you an apology.

174
00:12:40,825 --> 00:12:42,585
It was my fault.

175
00:12:42,665 --> 00:12:43,785
I was too harsh on you.

176
00:12:43,865 --> 00:12:46,585
If I had put myself in your shoes,

177
00:12:47,105 --> 00:12:49,425
things wouldn't have ended this way.

178
00:12:49,945 --> 00:12:51,385
You wouldn't have run into danger.

179
00:12:54,905 --> 00:12:56,425
I ask for your forgiveness.

180
00:12:57,865 --> 00:12:58,865
No need to apologize.

181
00:13:01,385 --> 00:13:03,105
I made this mess.

182
00:13:05,105 --> 00:13:07,265
And I will own up.

183
00:13:14,065 --> 00:13:15,305
You have no idea

184
00:13:15,385 --> 00:13:18,425
how worried your dad was
when he heard that you were in danger.

185
00:13:19,025 --> 00:13:21,545
He hailed a cab overnight at Mount Wu
and traveled over 400 kilometers here.

186
00:13:21,625 --> 00:13:22,465
I know.

187
00:13:26,905 --> 00:13:28,705
When he stood before the van,

188
00:13:29,465 --> 00:13:30,825
I already knew it.

189
00:13:31,945 --> 00:13:33,025
Xiaohe.

190
00:13:33,905 --> 00:13:35,185
It's okay, Uncle Ran.

191
00:13:36,945 --> 00:13:37,945
Don't worry about me.

192
00:13:38,025 --> 00:13:40,145
And no need to console me.

193
00:13:40,225 --> 00:13:41,745
I'm strong.

194
00:13:44,825 --> 00:13:47,305
Anyway, what happened
to Melon and the rest?

195
00:13:48,425 --> 00:13:49,465
Who?

196
00:13:49,545 --> 00:13:51,385
Those four guys on the esports team.

197
00:13:51,905 --> 00:13:53,865
After you raided the internet cafe,

198
00:13:54,385 --> 00:13:56,265
are they homeless now?

199
00:14:07,785 --> 00:14:09,065
Aren't we heading home?

200
00:14:28,465 --> 00:14:29,665
Eat slowly.

201
00:14:32,145 --> 00:14:34,105
Oh. Have you found a new base?

202
00:14:42,345 --> 00:14:44,305
We have been thinking a lot lately.

203
00:14:44,905 --> 00:14:46,785
There is no future in esports.

204
00:14:46,865 --> 00:14:47,785
It's better to go back home.

205
00:14:47,865 --> 00:14:50,185
We plan to work

206
00:14:50,785 --> 00:14:52,265
in a factory after the Chinese New Year.

207
00:14:55,265 --> 00:14:57,665
Who says there's no future in esports?

208
00:15:01,185 --> 00:15:03,105
It's the 21st century.

209
00:15:03,185 --> 00:15:04,985
As long as you work with computers,

210
00:15:05,065 --> 00:15:06,385
you have a future.

211
00:15:06,985 --> 00:15:10,545
Besides, all of you have worked
and trained so hard.

212
00:15:10,625 --> 00:15:12,305
If you don't have a match
with someone else,

213
00:15:12,385 --> 00:15:13,825
you'll bring shame to your own hard work.

214
00:15:13,905 --> 00:15:15,025
Exactly.

215
00:15:15,105 --> 00:15:16,505
What about the eggs I bought you guys?

216
00:15:19,745 --> 00:15:22,505
I know several cheap
and legit internet cafes.

217
00:15:22,585 --> 00:15:25,065
All of you will go to the police station
to get your identity cards done

218
00:15:25,145 --> 00:15:26,225
to prove that you're adults.

219
00:15:26,305 --> 00:15:27,905
Then, you can practice there.

220
00:15:34,465 --> 00:15:35,305
Here.

221
00:15:44,625 --> 00:15:47,785
Consider this an investment from me.

222
00:15:47,865 --> 00:15:49,425
Once you become popular,

223
00:15:49,505 --> 00:15:51,145
visit the Criminal Department
and pay me back.

224
00:15:53,865 --> 00:15:56,065
Thank you, Officer Ran.

225
00:15:56,945 --> 00:15:57,985
Dig in.

226
00:16:09,345 --> 00:16:11,265
Come. An extra braised egg for you.

227
00:16:12,265 --> 00:16:14,105
You're awesome, Uncle Ran.

228
00:16:14,185 --> 00:16:15,785
You're my idol for life.

229
00:16:15,865 --> 00:16:17,225
I'm so proud of you.

230
00:16:17,305 --> 00:16:18,785
Another chicken drumstick for you.

231
00:16:49,385 --> 00:16:50,305
What?

232
00:16:50,905 --> 00:16:53,185
Is my cholesterol not high enough?

233
00:16:54,505 --> 00:16:55,625
Forget it then.

234
00:16:56,465 --> 00:16:58,545
You can't put food
in my bowl and take it away.

235
00:17:08,424 --> 00:17:09,665
Uncle Ran,

236
00:17:10,184 --> 00:17:12,985
Melon and the guys
are ambitious, aren't they?

237
00:17:14,625 --> 00:17:15,985
They are good kids.

238
00:17:16,065 --> 00:17:17,905
They work hard and are committed.

239
00:17:17,985 --> 00:17:20,704
Why else did I give them
two months of my salary?

240
00:17:20,785 --> 00:17:21,745
Then,

241
00:17:22,505 --> 00:17:25,825
perhaps you should
support my dream as well.

242
00:17:26,345 --> 00:17:27,985
I want to study music in Beijing.

243
00:17:28,065 --> 00:17:30,025
I work hard and am committed.

244
00:17:30,105 --> 00:17:31,905
Music is not a proper job.

245
00:17:31,985 --> 00:17:34,225
Your priority now is to study

246
00:17:34,745 --> 00:17:36,345
and get into a good university.

247
00:17:38,225 --> 00:17:40,185
You were brave and smart inside the van

248
00:17:40,265 --> 00:17:41,665
with the human traffickers.

249
00:17:41,745 --> 00:17:43,505
You can be a criminal police officer.

250
00:17:43,585 --> 00:17:47,585
Do you want to join the police force
and make use of your talent?

251
00:17:49,465 --> 00:17:50,785
Actually,

252
00:17:50,865 --> 00:17:53,865
being an officer like you sounds cool.

253
00:17:56,025 --> 00:17:56,865
You

254
00:17:57,385 --> 00:18:00,385
will never be an excellent cop like Ran.

255
00:18:00,465 --> 00:18:01,985
Excuse me?

256
00:18:02,065 --> 00:18:03,545
I am just as smart as him,

257
00:18:03,625 --> 00:18:04,705
and I'm stronger than him.

258
00:18:06,825 --> 00:18:11,025
You can have your opinion.
I won't stop you.

259
00:18:11,105 --> 00:18:12,225
Just promise me

260
00:18:12,305 --> 00:18:13,625
that you'll study hard.

261
00:18:13,705 --> 00:18:15,345
After you graduate from high school,

262
00:18:15,425 --> 00:18:16,665
I'll send you to Beijing to study music.

263
00:18:17,465 --> 00:18:18,585
Why not after middle school?

264
00:18:18,665 --> 00:18:19,985
You have to graduate first.

265
00:18:20,585 --> 00:18:21,945
Be a literate rock artist.

266
00:18:22,025 --> 00:18:22,865
He's right.

267
00:18:22,945 --> 00:18:25,265
Don't just rock and roll.

268
00:18:26,345 --> 00:18:28,945
-Deal.
-Deal.

269
00:18:30,505 --> 00:18:31,305
We don't do that anymore.

270
00:18:38,945 --> 00:18:40,185
Deal.

271
00:18:40,265 --> 00:18:41,905
I will study now then.

272
00:18:47,145 --> 00:18:48,545
She is skipping her meal.

273
00:18:56,345 --> 00:18:57,705
Sir.

274
00:18:59,465 --> 00:19:00,745
Xiaohe wrote this song.

275
00:19:01,425 --> 00:19:04,025
Listen to it when you're free.
I think she's good.

276
00:19:04,105 --> 00:19:05,625
-Really?
-Yes.

277
00:19:10,425 --> 00:19:11,545
RESTRICTED AREA

278
00:19:16,745 --> 00:19:17,825
Let's have a drink.

279
00:19:19,825 --> 00:19:20,785
Sir.

280
00:19:21,305 --> 00:19:23,665
Your body hasn't recovered.
The doctor said you shouldn't drink.

281
00:19:24,705 --> 00:19:26,825
For this occasion, we must.

282
00:19:39,385 --> 00:19:40,905
Without you,

283
00:19:42,825 --> 00:19:44,665
my family would be all gone.

284
00:19:46,065 --> 00:19:49,505
I would be all alone for real.

285
00:19:50,225 --> 00:19:51,305
Thank you.

286
00:19:53,865 --> 00:19:56,625
Back then in the hospital,
you told me not to be sappy.

287
00:19:57,145 --> 00:19:58,745
Look who's being sappy now.

288
00:20:00,465 --> 00:20:01,545
Right.

289
00:20:07,945 --> 00:20:09,145
Oh, sir.

290
00:20:09,225 --> 00:20:11,905
Did you find anything useful on your trip?

291
00:20:16,145 --> 00:20:17,505
I told you not to drink,
but you wouldn't listen.

292
00:20:18,105 --> 00:20:19,585
Have some water.

293
00:20:24,705 --> 00:20:25,785
Sir,

294
00:20:26,745 --> 00:20:29,665
I'll request the higher-ups
to give you a longer break.

295
00:20:34,505 --> 00:20:36,985
HE YUANHANG, SECOND-CLASS MERIT

296
00:20:40,105 --> 00:20:41,585
I can't take my wage
without working for it.

297
00:20:43,225 --> 00:20:44,665
I want to give it one last shot

298
00:20:45,425 --> 00:20:47,145
and investigate Yuanlongli again.

299
00:20:49,425 --> 00:20:50,905
Even if I find nothing in the end,

300
00:20:52,265 --> 00:20:55,465
at the very least, I can close
the chapter once and for all.

301
00:21:10,585 --> 00:21:12,105
MISSING PERSON TURNED INTO KIDNAP

302
00:21:12,185 --> 00:21:13,665
FOUR TEENAGERS STILL MISSING

303
00:21:15,385 --> 00:21:16,705
ARE THE POLICE USELESS?

304
00:21:16,785 --> 00:21:18,065
ARE THEY DEAD OR ALIVE?

305
00:21:24,945 --> 00:21:26,585
How many days till the deadline?

306
00:21:36,065 --> 00:21:37,825
Captain Qu. Permission
to assign several policemen

307
00:21:37,905 --> 00:21:39,345
to assist me.

308
00:21:39,425 --> 00:21:41,425
I want to give it my last shot.

309
00:21:41,505 --> 00:21:42,505
Captain Qu.

310
00:21:43,025 --> 00:21:45,145
I'd like to work with Xiaohe.

311
00:21:46,345 --> 00:21:48,225
I want to work with Xiaohe too.

312
00:21:51,865 --> 00:21:54,025
He is the support I found for us.

313
00:21:54,105 --> 00:21:56,465
Old He, help us show them
what we're capable of.

314
00:21:58,425 --> 00:22:00,345
Old He?

315
00:22:00,425 --> 00:22:02,345
Who are you calling old here?

316
00:22:02,425 --> 00:22:03,665
Sorry.

317
00:22:03,745 --> 00:22:06,945
Perhaps we should just call you Mr. He.

318
00:22:07,025 --> 00:22:08,425
-Say it.
-Mr. He.

319
00:22:09,025 --> 00:22:10,105
That's nice.

320
00:22:10,185 --> 00:22:11,425
Mr. He,

321
00:22:11,505 --> 00:22:12,825
how will we investigate Yuanlongli?

322
00:22:12,905 --> 00:22:16,025
Mei is involved in many abduction cases.

323
00:22:16,105 --> 00:22:18,385
He is cunning and good at disguising.

324
00:22:18,465 --> 00:22:21,985
We cannot predict what he will do
by using a logical mind.

325
00:22:22,585 --> 00:22:23,865
For a serial abductor,

326
00:22:23,945 --> 00:22:27,865
the most dangerous place
is the safest place.

327
00:22:27,945 --> 00:22:30,425
That's how they hide under our noses.

328
00:22:30,505 --> 00:22:32,825
Dad. Just cut to the chase.

329
00:22:32,905 --> 00:22:36,025
Yuanlongli will be redeveloped soon.

330
00:22:36,105 --> 00:22:37,945
Many residents have moved away.

331
00:22:38,025 --> 00:22:40,065
All those empty units

332
00:22:40,145 --> 00:22:43,985
are the perfect hiding spot for Mei.

333
00:22:44,705 --> 00:22:46,905
Dad, how come you are so sure

334
00:22:46,985 --> 00:22:48,625
that Mei will be hiding under our noses?

335
00:22:48,705 --> 00:22:49,585
I'm not sure.

336
00:22:50,585 --> 00:22:54,465
But I have a feeling
that there's something more

337
00:22:55,465 --> 00:22:57,105
hiding in Yuanlongli.

338
00:23:20,985 --> 00:23:23,625
Officer He, you came to work again.

339
00:23:25,985 --> 00:23:28,825
Ma Qiang. Fire safety
is very important during winter.

340
00:23:28,905 --> 00:23:30,065
-All of you…
-Officer He.

341
00:23:30,145 --> 00:23:31,345
Officer He, you're here again.

342
00:23:33,345 --> 00:23:35,705
Honestly though, he has worked
as a policeman for so long.

343
00:23:35,785 --> 00:23:37,985
He finally cracked a big case

344
00:23:38,065 --> 00:23:39,225
and got a Second-Class Merit.

345
00:23:39,305 --> 00:23:40,905
Also, it was Officer Ran
who let him claim the credit.

346
00:23:41,585 --> 00:23:44,105
I also heard that his health is bad.

347
00:23:44,185 --> 00:23:45,705
He is claiming disability aid now.

348
00:23:47,025 --> 00:23:49,305
Wasn't the case closed already?

349
00:23:49,385 --> 00:23:51,145
Why is he still in Yuanlongli?

350
00:23:52,385 --> 00:23:53,785
He can't move on.

351
00:23:53,865 --> 00:23:55,985
He needs to feel useful.

352
00:24:10,865 --> 00:24:12,785
Go. Carry it. Quick.

353
00:24:13,905 --> 00:24:15,665
You two. It's good enough.

354
00:24:15,745 --> 00:24:17,065
Good enough. Hurry up now.

355
00:24:18,065 --> 00:24:19,305
Hurry up.

356
00:25:19,905 --> 00:25:21,105
Oh my!

357
00:25:22,225 --> 00:25:23,345
Officer He.

358
00:25:24,425 --> 00:25:25,465
What are you doing here?

359
00:25:29,145 --> 00:25:31,185
I'm here to look for leads.

360
00:25:31,265 --> 00:25:34,145
Give me the keys to the management office
of New York Block.

361
00:25:36,745 --> 00:25:38,745
The keys…

362
00:25:41,265 --> 00:25:43,145
Follow me to the office.

363
00:25:44,225 --> 00:25:45,545
Come.

364
00:25:52,905 --> 00:25:53,865
Officer He.

365
00:25:54,905 --> 00:25:56,185
The keys?

366
00:25:57,025 --> 00:25:58,025
What did you do?

367
00:26:00,185 --> 00:26:03,585
I… We are building a cement block.

368
00:26:08,545 --> 00:26:09,625
Seriously?

369
00:26:10,225 --> 00:26:11,505
A cement block here?

370
00:26:11,585 --> 00:26:13,465
Many people walk here. It's inconvenient.

371
00:26:13,545 --> 00:26:15,225
I'm trying to be considerate.

372
00:26:15,305 --> 00:26:18,065
The workers push
their wheelbarrows around.

373
00:26:18,145 --> 00:26:19,945
A barricade here

374
00:26:20,025 --> 00:26:22,945
can remind them not to hit anyone.

375
00:26:30,865 --> 00:26:32,145
The keys.

376
00:26:35,065 --> 00:26:36,185
Let's go.

377
00:26:36,265 --> 00:26:41,785
WEIYANG PUBLIC SECURITY
BUREAU NANSHAN BRANCH

378
00:26:47,265 --> 00:26:48,385
POLICE BY THE PEOPLE
FOR THE PEOPLE

379
00:26:48,465 --> 00:26:49,385
I was looking for you, Fangxu.

380
00:26:49,465 --> 00:26:51,305
Mei's accomplices confessed everything.

381
00:26:51,385 --> 00:26:52,745
But they do not know where his base is.

382
00:26:52,825 --> 00:26:54,065
Their communication
has always been unilateral.

383
00:26:56,745 --> 00:26:58,385
Grab a screenshot
from the internet cafe's footage.

384
00:26:58,465 --> 00:26:59,825
Then, update Mei's photo

385
00:26:59,905 --> 00:27:00,825
-in our internal system.
-Okay.

386
00:27:02,705 --> 00:27:04,465
Madam. Madam. Madam.

387
00:27:05,065 --> 00:27:06,105
I'm looking for the criminal police.

388
00:27:06,185 --> 00:27:07,025
What's the matter?

389
00:27:07,105 --> 00:27:08,065
I want to report a case.

390
00:27:08,145 --> 00:27:10,105
Come. Let's get you registered first.

391
00:27:10,185 --> 00:27:11,945
It's urgent. I need to report a case.

392
00:27:12,025 --> 00:27:13,145
Wu.

393
00:27:13,865 --> 00:27:15,385
-Captain Ran.
-Madam.

394
00:27:15,465 --> 00:27:16,785
Why are you looking
for the criminal police?

395
00:27:16,865 --> 00:27:18,185
I want to report a case.

396
00:27:18,265 --> 00:27:19,265
A murder in Yuanlongli.

397
00:27:32,585 --> 00:27:34,065
This place is foul.

398
00:27:34,145 --> 00:27:36,225
I rented this place for three years,

399
00:27:36,305 --> 00:27:38,545
and I had to pay for so many things.

400
00:27:38,625 --> 00:27:39,625
Buddy,

401
00:27:39,705 --> 00:27:40,785
are you looking for a place to stay?

402
00:27:40,865 --> 00:27:42,305
Run away now.

403
00:27:42,385 --> 00:27:43,945
This place only has bad luck.

404
00:27:44,025 --> 00:27:45,105
It's haunted.

405
00:27:45,185 --> 00:27:46,705
Just run. Save yourself.

406
00:27:46,785 --> 00:27:48,465
Whoever stays here is cursed.

407
00:27:58,745 --> 00:28:01,345
HUAINAN TEMPLE

408
00:28:17,825 --> 00:28:19,385
Mister,

409
00:28:19,465 --> 00:28:21,425
you seem troubled.

410
00:28:21,505 --> 00:28:23,585
Allow me to draw you

411
00:28:23,665 --> 00:28:25,505
an evil-cleansing talisman.

412
00:28:25,585 --> 00:28:26,745
Come.

413
00:28:27,745 --> 00:28:28,945
Come.

414
00:28:31,545 --> 00:28:33,345
Don't be so rough. Please.

415
00:28:33,425 --> 00:28:35,225
-Don't be so rough.
-Spread superstitions again

416
00:28:35,305 --> 00:28:37,265
-and I will arrest you.
-Don't be so rough.

417
00:28:37,345 --> 00:28:39,345
Don't be so rough.

418
00:28:39,425 --> 00:28:40,585
RAN

419
00:28:40,665 --> 00:28:41,905
-Don't be so rough.
-Shut up.

420
00:28:43,745 --> 00:28:45,385
-Sir.
-It hurts.

421
00:28:45,465 --> 00:28:46,305
<i>Where are you?</i>

422
00:28:46,385 --> 00:28:47,745
Where else can I be?

423
00:28:47,825 --> 00:28:49,185
<i>Come back to the station.</i>

424
00:28:49,705 --> 00:28:51,105
Let me investigate the floor first.

425
00:28:51,185 --> 00:28:52,625
<i>No need.</i>

426
00:28:52,705 --> 00:28:55,425
<i>We may no longer need to visit Yuanlongli.</i>

427
00:29:01,305 --> 00:29:02,225
<i>I'm not scared.</i>

428
00:29:02,825 --> 00:29:03,905
<i>I have money.</i>

429
00:29:03,985 --> 00:29:05,745
<i>I can kill many people,</i>
<i>and others will take the blame for me.</i>

430
00:29:05,825 --> 00:29:06,665
<i>You can't do anything.</i>

431
00:29:06,745 --> 00:29:08,745
<i>You can't do anything to me!</i>

432
00:29:09,465 --> 00:29:11,825
<i>You have two options.</i>

433
00:29:11,905 --> 00:29:13,705
<i>One, I'll burn the photos,</i>

434
00:29:13,785 --> 00:29:15,545
<i>and you'll go somewhere to lay low.</i>

435
00:29:15,625 --> 00:29:16,505
<i>Two,</i>

436
00:29:16,585 --> 00:29:19,225
<i>I'll send the photos and the recording</i>
<i>to the police.</i>

437
00:29:19,745 --> 00:29:22,265
<i>Do you want your freedom and money?</i>

438
00:29:22,345 --> 00:29:23,425
<i>It's your choice.</i>

439
00:29:27,385 --> 00:29:30,665
Director Li of Dongshan Mine
killed himself inside the police station

440
00:29:30,745 --> 00:29:31,785
five years ago.

441
00:29:31,865 --> 00:29:33,665
Today, his surviving wife
came to report a case.

442
00:29:33,745 --> 00:29:36,865
She claimed to have found
Director Li's hidden photos

443
00:29:36,945 --> 00:29:38,905
and recordings when she was moving out.

444
00:29:39,505 --> 00:29:43,545
This suggests Director Li
coerced Song Qingsong into leaving.

445
00:29:43,625 --> 00:29:46,425
But how did Director Li get these photos?

446
00:29:47,025 --> 00:29:49,985
Only two people had the opportunity
to give Director Li the photos.

447
00:29:50,825 --> 00:29:52,465
Cripple Du. Wu Shanlong.

448
00:29:52,545 --> 00:29:54,465
I'm inclined to believe
it was Wu Shanlong.

449
00:29:54,545 --> 00:29:55,825
After all, he stood to profit the most

450
00:29:55,905 --> 00:29:57,865
after Song Qingsong left.

451
00:29:57,945 --> 00:30:00,145
We also found a photocopy
of the tender document

452
00:30:00,225 --> 00:30:02,665
inside Wu Shanlong's home.

453
00:30:02,745 --> 00:30:04,785
While he refused to admit
that he kept the document,

454
00:30:05,305 --> 00:30:07,225
it doesn't mean
that he didn't use the photocopy

455
00:30:07,305 --> 00:30:09,105
to blackmail Song Qingsong.

456
00:30:10,145 --> 00:30:10,985
I even suspect

457
00:30:11,065 --> 00:30:13,865
that the blackmailing letter
written to Song Qingsong by Xu Meng

458
00:30:13,945 --> 00:30:15,065
was forged by him.

459
00:30:17,625 --> 00:30:20,225
Song Qingsong never would have thought

460
00:30:20,305 --> 00:30:22,985
that his brother-in-law was the one
who sabotaged him.

461
00:30:27,505 --> 00:30:30,865
Unfortunately, she failed to escape.

462
00:30:40,065 --> 00:30:42,665
The main culprit, Wu Shanlong, is dead.

463
00:30:43,265 --> 00:30:44,985
The one who hired a hitman, Song Qingsong,

464
00:30:45,065 --> 00:30:47,025
fled abroad for many years.

465
00:30:48,625 --> 00:30:51,865
All we can do now
is to release a wanted poster.

466
00:30:54,105 --> 00:30:55,545
But I don't understand one thing.

467
00:30:56,865 --> 00:30:59,625
Wu Shanlong isn't smart.

468
00:31:01,305 --> 00:31:03,665
How could he devise so many plans?

469
00:31:19,305 --> 00:31:21,105
Ms. Zhao, you're out.

470
00:31:21,185 --> 00:31:23,225
Ms. Zhao, you look so beautiful.

471
00:31:23,305 --> 00:31:25,505
After our new treatment,

472
00:31:25,585 --> 00:31:26,985
you look younger and prettier.

473
00:31:28,225 --> 00:31:30,665
I have solid genes. My heels.

474
00:31:30,745 --> 00:31:32,945
XINXIN BEAUTY SALON

475
00:31:33,025 --> 00:31:35,225
Young girls like you

476
00:31:35,305 --> 00:31:37,425
shouldn't just chase
after physical beauty blindly.

477
00:31:37,505 --> 00:31:40,225
A woman's real charisma
doesn't come from her face,

478
00:31:40,865 --> 00:31:41,985
but here.

479
00:31:44,505 --> 00:31:48,105
Ms. Zhao. The balance
on your membership card is running low.

480
00:31:48,185 --> 00:31:49,745
Do you want to…

481
00:31:52,425 --> 00:31:53,225
Top up another 10,000 yuan.

482
00:31:53,305 --> 00:31:56,905
How generous of you, Ms. Zhao.

483
00:31:57,425 --> 00:31:58,825
Men are unreliable.

484
00:31:59,505 --> 00:32:01,185
As women, we should treat ourselves.

485
00:32:01,265 --> 00:32:02,105
See you.

486
00:32:02,905 --> 00:32:04,505
Bye, Ms. Zhao.

487
00:32:04,585 --> 00:32:05,705
Come back again.

488
00:32:05,785 --> 00:32:07,145
Drive safely.

489
00:32:08,865 --> 00:32:10,025
I'm so sick of her.

490
00:32:10,105 --> 00:32:11,185
Listen.

491
00:32:11,265 --> 00:32:13,745
She used to open
a foot massage parlor too.

492
00:32:13,825 --> 00:32:15,865
She found a guy called Wu Shanlong,

493
00:32:15,945 --> 00:32:18,265
and they both took over a cement factory.

494
00:32:18,345 --> 00:32:20,305
That's how she became rich.

495
00:32:20,385 --> 00:32:22,345
-Is that so?
-Yes.

496
00:32:23,585 --> 00:32:25,105
So, she still relied on a man in the end.

497
00:33:06,145 --> 00:33:09,185
YUANLONGLI INTERNATIONAL GARDEN

498
00:33:19,505 --> 00:33:22,265
Ma Qiang. Give me the list of Yuanlongli's
current residents and tenants.

499
00:33:22,345 --> 00:33:23,385
Several copies of it.

500
00:33:23,465 --> 00:33:25,945
Officer He, what is this for?

501
00:33:26,025 --> 00:33:27,345
Just do what you're told.

502
00:33:33,145 --> 00:33:34,745
How many units have been vacated?

503
00:33:34,825 --> 00:33:36,025
Many.

504
00:33:36,105 --> 00:33:37,785
They are marked in red there.

505
00:33:39,065 --> 00:33:40,425
2015 YUANLONGLI PROPERTY
OWNER/TENANT ROSTER

506
00:33:40,505 --> 00:33:41,785
It seems like we have a busy night ahead.

507
00:33:41,865 --> 00:33:43,265
Let's split up.

508
00:33:43,345 --> 00:33:46,105
Zheng Zhong, you, Bai, and Hui
are in charge of Floors 1 to 9.

509
00:33:46,185 --> 00:33:47,585
Xiaohe and I will check the ones upstairs.

510
00:33:47,665 --> 00:33:49,505
Use the walkie-talkie
if you find anything.

511
00:33:49,585 --> 00:33:50,585
Understood.

512
00:34:03,345 --> 00:34:06,545
DEMOLITION

513
00:34:20,225 --> 00:34:22,025
The vacant units on the eastern side
of the 4th floor

514
00:34:22,105 --> 00:34:23,145
are 13 and 16.

515
00:34:23,824 --> 00:34:24,665
Let's check 13 first.

516
00:35:56,745 --> 00:35:58,545
It hurts! Be gentle. It hurts!

517
00:35:58,625 --> 00:35:59,945
Shut up!

518
00:36:12,985 --> 00:36:14,545
An escape room?

519
00:36:15,065 --> 00:36:17,985
Do you even have the license for it?

520
00:36:18,905 --> 00:36:20,345
It's so late at night.

521
00:36:20,425 --> 00:36:22,705
You're doing this instead of sleeping.

522
00:36:22,785 --> 00:36:25,105
This is a nuisance, do you hear me?

523
00:36:25,945 --> 00:36:27,225
Sorry, sir.

524
00:36:27,305 --> 00:36:28,385
We've made a mistake.

525
00:36:28,465 --> 00:36:29,585
We've made a mistake.

526
00:36:29,665 --> 00:36:30,545
We'll leave now.

527
00:36:30,625 --> 00:36:31,865
-Now.
-Go.

528
00:36:31,945 --> 00:36:32,985
Sorry, sir.

529
00:36:33,065 --> 00:36:34,545
Sorry. Sorry.

530
00:36:38,745 --> 00:36:40,065
<i>Mr. He. Mr. He.</i>

531
00:36:40,665 --> 00:36:43,025
<i>We've searched all nine floors.</i>
<i>Nothing unusual.</i>

532
00:36:44,945 --> 00:36:46,225
Copy.

533
00:36:51,065 --> 00:36:53,185
RESIDENTS
TENANTS REGISTRATION FORM

534
00:36:55,065 --> 00:36:56,985
RESIDENT, TENANT, RESIDENT

535
00:36:58,865 --> 00:37:01,705
Dad, Mei loves to use a fake identity.

